          "benefits_md": "\n- **Financial Assistance:** ₹1,00,000/- (One Lakh Rupees) per eligible market committee.\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "This scheme provides financial assistance to market committees in Gujarat to establish e-market facilities, aligning with the National Agriculture Market Policy for a unified national e-market.\n\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "\"A Scheme to Provide Assistance for Building E-Market Facilities in Market Committees\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support market committees to set up e-market facilities, enhancing transparency and efficiency in agricultural marketing across the state."
                }
              ],
